SY_TALK("W2UV50MWG1s",[[1,["Today I am going to talk to you about attention."]],[20,["What is attention, what is the movement of attention"]],[31,["and what are the ways and methods of raising our attention."]],[41,["Keep it in broad ways. Alright?"]],[47,["But when I am saying all these things"]],[48,["you must know that I am talking to you individually"]],[51,["– it’s not about others."]],[53,["Always the first thing human beings do is, when I am speaking to you,"]],[58,["you try to find out about who Mataji is speaking!"]],[62,["This is the best way of putting your attention onto something else."]],[67,["If you put your attention to yourself that,"]],[69,["“This is for me and me and me alone,”"]],[72,["then it will have an effect, because these [words of mine] are mantras."]],[78,["And that’s why it is wasted"]],[80,["because whatever is given to you is thrown onto another person."]],[86,["So the attention, that you have, is the only way to know the reality."]],[97,["Your own attention is important,"]],[99,["not the attention of others or your attention on others!"]],[102,["This must be clearly understood."]],[105,["If you understand this point that the whole thing"]],[108,["is to be consumed by you,"]],[111,["through your attention to raise yourself to a higher situation,"]],[115,["it will work out. Otherwise, it is like giving food to you"]],[118,["and going to another person who is getting nourished,"]],[120,["while you are getting nothing."]],[121,["And that person also may not be able get nourished,"]],[126,["because he doesn’t know that you are throwing it to that person."]],[131,["So today, as I am going to speak to you about attention,"]],[134,["you should know that your attention should absorb all that I am saying."]],[141,["It is not meant for anybody else."]],[144,["You better sit in thoughtless awareness, that’s the best way,"]],[147,["so that it goes into you. Otherwise it’s like a lecture, you know."]],[152,["That you listen to me has no effect."]],[154,["Every lecture will transform you because, after all, I am speaking."]],[161,["But because you always think of others"]],[164,["and you think of your problems all the time"]],[167,["– something nonsensical is going on, about which you are worried –"]],[171,["and the attention is so overloaded"]],[173,["that whatever is said to you doesn’t go into you."]],[177,["So, just now, utilise it by being attentive and knowing"]],[181,["that all these nonsensical things have no value."]],[185,["It’s your attention that has to come up and has to grow."]],[195,["So, attention is the whole of the canvas of your being"]],[209,["– is a complete canvas, is the attention."]],[213,["Complete canvas of your being is the attention."]],[218,["How much you have gone into it, how much you have discovered it,"]],[221,["how far you have raised it is a different point."]],[229,["Attention is Chitta and God is attention."]],[236,["How far your attention has been enlightened is a different point."]],[241,["But your attention is God"]],[249,["– if you become enlightened to that extent."]],[256,["It is like a canvas."]],[258,["You can say it is like a canvas which is spread out for a film,"]],[265,["and whatever aptitudes"]],[269,["or, you can say, the drags or movements, your attention has,"]],[274,["shows on that canvas."]],[279,["I don’t know what is the word for ‘vritti’ in English language."]],[285,["It’s not aptitude, but a person gets prone to, or his attention is dragged to"]],[291,["– I don’t know [if] there is a word like that in English language – vritti."]],[295,["Can you suggest any word?"]],[299,["So our attention is just a pure, completely pure canvas"]],[310,["and is acted upon by the three gunas we have, to begin with."]],[318,["And the three gunas come to you, as you know,"]],[320,["one from your past, one from your future sense and one from the present."]],[330,["Now, whatever have been your experiences about"]],[337,["a particular thing or a particular occasion,"]],[343,["so far, is completely recorded in your memory."]],[350,["For example, if you see the black colour:"]],[354,["all that goes with the black colour is recorded in your memory."]],[360,["As soon as you see this black colour, quite a lot of it comes up."]],[369,["That means, as soon as you see this with your attention,"]],[375,["the attention gets muddled up, or you can say the attention gets coloured"]],[381,["with all the memories about this black colour."]],[388,["And then your action takes place"]],[390,["according to the way your attention is affected."]],[398,["For example, just now something was burned by these flames."]],[406,["Now, all of you became aware of it."]],[410,["Next time whenever you will see a flame,"]],[413,["first thing [that] will happen will be that you will be cautious about it."]],[418,["It is not going to happen again,"]],[420,["but the whole memory will come to you"]],[423,["and you will try to be cautious or warn others,"]],[428,["because your attention will become aware of that"]],[434,["as soon as you will see that, because that canvas of your attention"]],[441,["itself will start throwing out these pictures, out of itself,"]],[447,["through your past experiences, on to the canvas."]],[452,["This is a living canvas."]],[458,["Or may be that if you have got some ideas which you have premeditated,"]],[467,["or thought of, of the future."]],[472,["For example, you must have thought of somebody that,"]],[475,["“If I meet that man I will tell him like this.”"]],[478,["As soon as you will meet that man,"]],[482,["your attention will start bubbling out with those ideas"]],[487,["that are coming about this man,"]],[489,["and you will start addressing to him accordingly."]],[491,["It’s all stored up within you,"]],[493,["whether it is about the future or about the past."]],[497,["It’s given out of the attention through that bubbling process"]],[505,["which depends on your dragging nature, where are you dragged."]],[510,["That’s called as vritti, but I don’t know what you call it in English language."]],[514,["I do not know what is the, what you are prone to (tendency)."]],[519,["Vritti is a very neutral word. It doesn’t mean anything bad."]],[523,["It means where you are drawn to."]],[525,["Vritti means a temperament by which you are drawn to."]],[528,["And whatever is your temperament, it acts like that."]],[532,["For example, if you see a man walking, say, blindly"]],[540,["– he cannot see things –"]],[542,["one person may get angry with that person,"]],[546,["another may have pity for that person,"]],[549,["third may come forward to help him out."]],[552,["It’s the vritti, it’s the temperament,"]],[554,["that you have developed through your three gunas."]],[562,["That’s why this attention becomes identified with you."]],[570,["And when you are identified with this, your vritti, your temperaments,"]],[579,["then you are still in a misidentified area."]],[586,["Let us take a case of somebody who has been possessed before."]],[594,["Now, coming to Sahaja Yoga his possession goes away."]],[600,["But the memory remains in the brain that he was possessed."]],[604,["And [if] the memory is stronger in a person, left side is stronger,"]],[609,["then that memory lingers on,"]],[613,["and as soon as that person comes in contact with anyone"]],[618,["which has got something to do with the past possession, it clicks."]],[623,["And the whole thing starts coming into you bubbling out"]],[626,["and you think you are again possessed."]],[631,["It is the memory which gives you [this reaction]. It’s a myth."]],[637,["It’s the memory that tells you, “Oh, you are again possessed!”"]],[641,["Because your left side is weak, means you always live in your memory."]],[646,["Your memory is stronger than yourself."]],[650,["If you could make yourself stronger than your memory,"]],[653,["nothing can possess you."]],[662,["But after you get your Realisation,"]],[669,["you are not still identified with that state of mind"]],[675,["in which you see your ego and superego as myths."]],[684,["Still you get caught up into your ego and superego,"]],[689,["and that’s why your attention is still in a mess."]],[696,["In a pure simple way of attention in an innocent child,"]],[704,["he sees everything in pratyaksha,"]],[707,["means in actual experiencing of something – for a child –"]],[712,["because he has no memory."]],[714,["So he’ll have to burn his hand to feel that this burns."]],[720,["He has to touch something cold to know that it is cold."]],[724,["His memory is not yet built up."]],[726,["So into the actual experiencing of it he lives."]],[736,["But that actual experiencing becomes memory."]],[741,["And once the memory is built up stronger,"]],[744,["the whole personality is affected by memory."]],[748,["All the conditioning of all kinds come through that;"]],[753,["your reading, even the whole atmosphere can come to you."]],[759,["You see, sometimes you smell a particular soap,"]],[763,["or say a rose, you smell it –"]],[766,["then all the memories of smelling such a rose, sometimes,"]],[770,["comes to you and you may feel really elated sometimes,"]],[773,["maybe sometimes, maybe, or sometimes very unhappy,"]],[775,["whatever may be the situation."]],[778,["So you may feel happy or unhappy."]],[783,["Because, whatever experiences you have had,"]],[787,["has given you a memory."]],[790,["This memory might have given you a superego,"]],[794,["or might have given you a ego."]],[797,["This scanning might have taken place."]],[799,["If it has been a ego and a superego,"]],[803,["then may be that, if it was ego you must have felt happy."]],[808,["If it is satisfying to your ego you feel very happy."]],[813,["If it is not, if it is superego, if you are suppressed by this,"]],[817,["then you feel very unhappy."]],[819,["So both things like happiness or unhappiness"]],[822,["are the states where you are still in the myth,"]],[828,["still the myth exists. You have to still go beyond."]],[832,["So if you feel happy about some situation, you should know you"]],[835,["are only happy before Realisation,"]],[839,["because it is giving some support to your ego to bloat."]],[847,["And if you are unhappy, then you should know that"]],[850,["there is some sort of a suppression on your ego"]],[854,["and there’s a superego developing."]],[856,["So both the situations have been of no help to you,"]],[865,["of no help to you for your growth,"]],[868,["except that both these institutions develop so much"]],[872,["that you are away from the real experiencing."]],[881,["The real experiencing stops"]],[884,["because your attention is so much muddled up."]],[890,["So on one side if you move – on the left hand side –"]],[896,["your attention is muddled up with fear, with pain,"]],[902,["with unhappiness, with hopelessness, dejection."]],[914,["The other side, if you indulge too much on to the right hand side"]],[920,["– little bit also –"]],[922,["you start getting elated, excited, over-dominating."]],[932,["The colour of the left side is blue."]],[938,["And the blue colour starts changing to the black."]],[944,["While on the right hand side it is, to begin with, yellow,"]],[950,["light yellow or you can say golden,"]],[953,["then yellow, then orange and then red."]],[958,["So you go to aggression on the right hand side."]],[961,["On the left hand side you go into a complete state of"]],[970,["entropy, you can call it,"]],[971,["or a state where you are separated from yourself"]],[975,["into a complete frozen state."]],[979,["So [on] one side you become completely frozen,"]],[981,["on the other side you become completely heated up."]],[986,["Both these things are, again, movement on the wrong direction."]],[993,["Even in the centre when the attention is kept"]],[997,["– that you keep your attention more in the centre –"]],[1002,["there also, because it’s a very sensitive point, it doesn’t stay there."]],[1009,["For example,"]],[1012,["when we, say, use fire, we can use it for burning the house."]],[1019,["In the same way we can use it for creating smoke."]],[1024,["But we can also use this fire in its proper way, if we use it,"]],[1030,["in its proper proportion, for cooking the food [or] for giving us light."]],[1035,["If it is too much, it can burn like a big fire."]],[1042,["If it is too little, it can burn like smoke."]],[1046,["But in the center when you know how to balance it,"]],[1049,["then you can use it for your own purpose"]],[1051,["– for cooking or for giving light, and then for a puja too."]],[1060,["So in the same way when we really balance our gunas properly,"]],[1070,["then we become gradually the master of the whole situation."]],[1078,["The attention doesn’t get dragged"]],[1084,["into things that we have been doing"]],[1087,["or that we have understood through our memories"]],[1090,["or through our experiences or whatever it is,"]],[1093,["and is not also dragged towards, too much, on the right hand side"]],[1096,["that we try to overpower, or try to dominate someone."]],[1102,["Because if you move too much that side you have seen [that] it becomes blood."]],[1107,["It is difficult for people to understand how,"]],[1110,["when people become very religious-minded, like now Iran,"]],[1117,["the movement is on the right"]],[1119,["– all the austerities, all that, everything – now bloodshed."]],[1124,["Christians also did the same."]],[1127,["Brahmins did the same in India."]],[1130,["Buddhists did the same, even [though] they talked of nonviolence"]],[1135,["they got to bloodshed, because movement started [on the] right hand side."]],[1141,["Left hand side movement will take you to very sly and dark methods."]],[1149,["So right-handed sided people – like big nations"]],[1152,["who are supposed to be developed nations –"]],[1156,["they justify war."]],[1159,["“We must have weapons to face each other.”"]],[1162,["But you all, each other, are the same people from God’s point of view!"]],[1165,["Why are you fighting?"]],[1169,["When God asks you, “Why are you fighting, what is the need?"]],[1172,["Why don’t you sit down properly and listen to each other?"]],[1175,["What are you fighting about?"]],[1177,["You are fighting about land. Is it your father’s land? It belongs to God!"]],[1182,["God has created this land. Why are you fighting?”"]],[1185,["But your attention is such that immediately you think,"]],[1188,["“Oh, this is my land, this is my motherland,"]],[1191,["this is my fatherland, this is my brotherland.”"]],[1193,["But what about your land which is within you? It’s not your own!"]],[1198,["So if you go on telling these people"]],[1200,["that we should have no war they will not listen."]],[1204,["Realisation is the only way."]],[1206,["By Realisation your attention gets higher"]],[1210,["and gets separated from that strata from where these things bubble in."]],[1215,["Do you understand my point now?"]],[1218,["The strata goes higher, the attention goes higher, at a higher state."]],[1223,["And these things [Inaudible]"]],[1227,["By right side movement you get vikshepa, confusion. First you get confusion."]],[1234,["Every intellectual, whatever brilliant he may be, he is confused."]],[1238,["And the more confused he is, the more he asserts himself"]],[1243,["because he is confused, he’s not sure of himself, so he asserts,"]],[1246,["“This is the thing; this is the thing.”"]],[1248,["I mean, if it is so, why should you assert it?"]],[1251,["But he goes on asserting, “This is the thing!”"]],[1254,["Then understand that now he is going towards lunatic asylum – absolutely!"]],[1257,["And the way he asserts, and goes on talking about it,"]],[1261,["all the time, that means he is not sure."]],[1267,["He becomes like a possessed personality."]],[1272,["When he explains everything through his brains that"]],[1278,["“This is the thing. This is correct. We must all do, this is what…”"]],[1281,["and he convinces many others who are confused like him."]],[1284,["They depend on him. He becomes a leader because, you see,"]],[1287,["they are much more confused"]],[1289,["and they find somebody who is not so much confused outwardly"]],[1292,["[so] they stick on to him, and all of them get to war"]],[1296,["or some sort of a bloodshed or some sort of – they want to see blood."]],[1304,["They become heartless, passionless, compassionless,"]],[1308,["you can say – compassionless, loveless people."]],[1312,["The other movement is the blue side, is like the blue moonlight."]],[1317,["So, for the romanticism starts."]],[1320,["Sitting in the moonlight, you see!"]],[1323,["The ideas start coming from Lord Byron (laughter)."]],[1332,["And they come into your attention"]],[1335,["– then it becomes very strong passion with you."]],[1338,["You think, “Oh, I am still, I have to find out my loves!”"]],[1344,["And you go on in search of your loves and this and that."]],[1348,["These things are not really giving joy."]],[1352,["That’s why so many poems have been written that,"]],[1358,["“Love is the most painful thing, it’s worse than death,”"]],[1363,["and all sorts of poems are written like that"]],[1367,["so why did you get into it?"]],[1369,["I mean, it’s already written down, books after books,"]],[1372,["still why do you get into it? (laughing)"]],[1374,["You are already warned about it that,"]],[1378,["“Don’t go after love, love is deception, love is this, that,"]],[1383,["it is very temporary, it is for the little while you get that.”"]],[1388,["By chance, if somebody could stop at a point"]],[1391,["by marrying somebody who is sweet enough and realise"]],[1396,["that love and marriage and all these things are in the centre,"]],[1401,["are like the fire in the kitchen,"]],[1404,["are like the fire in the temple:"]],[1409,["looks after it and doesn’t overdo something about it."]],[1414,["Then maybe that this may be utilized."]],[1419,["In the same way the right side movement of the Sun line."]],[1425,["If people think that, yes, the sun is important,"]],[1429,["we have to have sun in the house,"]],[1432,["but you are not to become naked and insult the Sun and get your skin cancer!"]],[1439,["Sun is not for your skin cancer!"]],[1442,["But if you overdo it, also it is dangerous."]],[1447,["A person who exposes himself too much to planning"]],[1453,["and doing that, and doing this, and doing all this,"]],[1456,["can land up into very great difficulties."]],[1460,["So you have to balance that side also"]],[1462,["and this side and you have to be in the centre, in the equilibrium."]],[1468,["Now this word ‘equilibrium’ doesn’t exist in our day-to-day life."]],[1472,["It exists only in the fiction"]],[1475,["or may be in the so-called scientific research."]],[1480,["But as far as human beings are concerned,"]],[1482,["they do not know what is equilibrium is."]],[1485,["Because of this, the attention, though after Realisation"]],[1490,["comes up, still on the sides they just go down,"]],[1495,["this side or that side according to your vrittis."]],[1499,["And when these identifications still act in them,"]],[1504,["they are prone to go down again in their attention"]],[1511,["and again start bubbling out the same thing as they had."]],[1516,["Now one has to become lighter in one’s own mind"]],[1524,["and should think that, “We have dropped all that now why are we there?”"]],[1529,["One should become lighter with all that load flowing out,"]],[1534,["because you are here to raise your attention higher and higher"]],[1542,["so that you come up to a point"]],[1545,["where you become one with the attention of God."]],[1551,["Already your attention is sparkled because through your attention"]],[1556,["you can see what’s wrong with you,"]],[1558,["you can see what’s wrong with others"]],[1561,["and you can see how far you are going with yourself."]],[1565,["But the progress is retarded because you do not know that this attention"]],[1571,["is pure form and all that you get into this attention"]],[1576,["is a mythical stuff, is a myth."]],[1584,["If you drop this myth gradually, treat everything as a myth"]],[1590,["and not depend on becoming unhappy or happy"]],[1594,["– just seeing the thing –"]],[1596,["[then] your attention will take a flight"]],[1598,["and it will be at a much higher level residing there."]],[1603,["Instead of that, every moment you go this way or that way"]],[1608,["– it goes on like that – and the movement upwards is much less."]],[1613,["Even in Sattvoguna, when you rise,"]],[1616,["you can go much worse in that condition also."]],[1620,["For example, if you say that, “I am trying to be Sattwoguni.”"]],[1624,["In Sattwoguni it is that you start seeing everything,"]],[1633,["discriminating through your understanding"]],[1637,["– not through vibrations – through understanding:"]],[1639,["“Oh! Should we not somehow or the other take out our attention from here?”"]],[1647,["“Should we not give up this?”"]],[1651,["“Should we be charitable?” “Should we go and serve the people?”"]],[1655,["There are people who think, “Oh, we are going to do something great!”"]],[1660,["– like your Salvation Army."]],[1663,["Let them be salvaged by themselves!"]],[1665,["I don’t know what salvation they are going to do."]],[1667,["So these ideas – ideas, I am saying – of Sattvoguna,"]],[1672,["can also immobilise you and can really freeze you down once for all,"]],[1677,["and that also can work in you in such a sly manner,"]],[1682,["we can say, in such a secretive manner, that you won’t feel it."]],[1688,["All these ideas of helping others, being charitable,"]],[1691,["“Let’s have a charity association!” – finished!"]],[1694,["Once you work in a charity association, your attention is finished there."]],[1700,["But if your attention goes higher"]],[1704,["– say [as] my attention is. I am only nothing but charity! I mean what am I?"]],[1708,["It just flows. You just become the charity."]],[1717,["So the difference between"]],[1719,["a person who is a realised and a not realised is this"]],[1723,["that the attention which was giving myth as reality to you"]],[1731,["is gone now, is gone higher."]],[1734,["It can see that it is myth."]],[1736,["Attention can clearly see that it is myth,"]],[1740,["and you can see that yourself and you can remove yourself from them."]],[1750,["That, of course, I have to give you a push, no doubt,"]],[1752,["and I am working hard on that to give you a push."]],[1755,["But you should also know that mythical things must be dropped out,"]],[1759,["otherwise you will not grow."]],[1762,["All mythical things must be dropped out."]],[1766,["And the best way to do it is to be in thoughtless awareness"]],[1769,["because as soon as you transcend these three gunas"]],[1772,["you become thoughtlessly aware."]],[1774,["You have to cross Agya. Once you cross Agya, these three gunas,"]],[1778,["absolutely you go into a state where you are gunateet,"]],[1783,["you are beyond gunas."]],[1787,["So you do not deliberately do anything,"]],[1791,["but it just works out."]],[1796,["But analysis is one of the diseases of the West."]],[1800,["What are you analysing? What are you analysing? You ask yourself."]],[1805,["I feel like laughing at the whole analysis that goes on."]],[1809,["See, they’ll sit down, take out a hair, splitting the hair into hundred!"]],[1813,["And great analysers are sitting down there!"]],[1818,["They cannot even say how the chromosomes"]],[1821,["have that spindle action"]],[1824,["and, I mean at that minute level the things are worked out."]],[1831,["They cannot say how a cell divides."]],[1838,["What are they analysing sitting down here?"]],[1842,["Now, they have analysed for a purpose – also done for God."]],[1847,["Through their analysis now my things are recorded."]],[1852,["Through their analysis I can go to the TV,"]],[1855,["if they allow me any time, because of analysis [it] doesn’t fit into me,"]],[1858,["they won’t allow, they may not, it might be expedited."]],[1864,["But say, for example, if you had not discovered these things –"]],[1866,["for example take it like that –"]],[1870,["and the science was not discovered,"]],[1874,["your attention would have been at least better off."]],[1880,["Because of science, your attention is also very much in confusion."]],[1886,["So I don’t know which one to praise, whether the science or the primitiveness."]],[1894,["When you raised yourself to science also,"]],[1897,["you got to another extreme as usual."]],[1899,["Till you burnt out your complete attention, you were not satisfied."]],[1903,["I mean if you had kept your balance in science also"]],[1907,["it would have helped, but the balance was lost there."]],[1910,["Give anything to human beings"]],[1912,["and they know how to make the worst out of it."]],[1916,["They will go to the extreme. You give them a horse, they cannot go"]],[1920,["ordinary trotting or galloping, they must have a double gallop,"]],[1924,["till they fall and die!"]],[1926,["Everything you see, they just are on the run all the time."]],[1932,["So first thing is needed is to steady down yourself"]],[1935,["and tell yourself that, “Now all these mythical things"]],[1938,["I am not going to allow to come to my attention.”"]],[1943,["All these things are nothing but myths."]],[1946,["But you are giving too much importance to myths."]],[1950,["You are taking them bit so seriously. They are just mythical."]],[1954,["Now, I mean, when you are realised now you laugh at people"]],[1958,["who just go mad over say, a moonlit night."]],[1964,["Alright? But ask the fellow who is doing that,"]],[1967,["he’ll say, “You are heartless, you have no feelings!”"]],[1972,["He’ll give you a big poetry out of it."]],[1977,["You go and see anyone of these people who are riding a high horse,"]],[1981,["who are at the helm of affairs,"]],[1983,["and you will feel like laughing at them."]],[1985,["But they will think that, “You are useless, you are doing no work,"]],[1991,["you are good for nothing, you are just wasters.”"]],[1997,["So now for you, because you are enlightened now, is to understand"]],[2000,["that our attention has to move higher and higher, at a higher space."]],[2008,["Now actually what has happened in Realisation?"]],[2012,["Your Kundalini has risen and has come up,"]],[2018,["just like, you can say, a small, thin hair, one hair,"]],[2029,["and that has broken your Sahastrara"]],[2034,["and now the grace is flowing into you."]],[2039,["But it’s a very small movement that has taken place, of course"]],[2042,["which is a very difficult movement no doubt, but it has taken place."]],[2048,["Now you have not expanded like this."]],[2054,["Your chakras are only pierced in the centre,"]],[2058,["but the rest of the attention is still intact."]],[2061,["Actually it is so intact, that you don’t even feel that it is pierced."]],[2067,["Now you have to expand that, open it out,"]],[2073,["so that more strands of Kundalini can rise"]],[2079,["and your attention, which is in these centers, expands."]],[2089,["By expansion it drives out all that is mythical on the sides."]],[2093,["On every centre we have our attention,"]],[2099,["which is being enlightened in the centre"]],[2102,["through this Light passing through."]],[2106,["But the Light is too small for the darkness that you have collected."]],[2112,["Specially for the people of the West, I would say,"]],[2115,["your confusions, you must get rid of them."]],[2121,["But still you identify."]],[2123,["Because if I ask you anything [like], “How are you?”"]],[2126,["Means what?"]],[2130,["Means you are still confused."]],[2134,["Alright?"]],[2139,["Confusion should go."]],[2142,["One confusion was there that, “This is Realisation or not?”"]],[2147,["I hope that’s over now with you people."]],[2149,["At least now you believe it is Self-realisation."]],[2152,["I had to tell people, “No, you are self-realised now, you are!”"]],[2155,["Still they would jump up like [a] jack-in-the-box, you see."]],[2159,["They’ll say, “No, we’re not Mother!"]],[2161,["How do you say this is Realisation?”"]],[2163,["“We expect this out of Realisation and that out of Realisation"]],[2167,["– that we’ll be flying out of the door if we are Realised,”"]],[2170,["or something nonsensical like that."]],[2172,["Thank God, these ideas have gone away."]],[2175,["But when we are Realised, there is Light that has come in us,"]],[2181,["we have to grow it only by separating our attention"]],[2185,["from the myths."]],[2189,["It’s all mythical."]],[2191,["I also play with you,"]],[2193,["because unless and until you are sure,"]],[2199,["I am not going to give you a wrong idea about yourself."]],[2207,["I want to see how far still your attention is moving,"]],[2212,["and I know [that] still you are not sure,"]],[2218,["still you are not sure of yourself,"]],[2224,["that’s why the confidence is not there."]],[2232,["First of all you have to learn how to drive, then you are tested."]],[2237,["There will be five stones put together,"]],[2240,["the distance will be only that hardly a car can pass through"]],[2245,["and the fellow will say, “You bring it zigzag!”"]],[2248,["And you cannot do it."]],[2250,["Why?"]],[2253,["That’s how he makes you a master."]],[2259,["The mastery of your attention"]],[2263,["will come when you will start seeing that it is all a myth that upsets you."]],[2269,["It’s all a myth that upsets you."]],[2273,["Just throw it away."]],[2277,["Just throw it away and understand"]],[2281,["that you are the eternal attention,"]],[2287,["that you are the eternal life,"]],[2292,["that [the] only thing that keeps you away from it is ignorance,"]],[2299,["and the ignorance is too simple to understand:"]],[2303,["that you have accepted myth as Truth."]],[2309,["Just drop it! It’s all myth!"]],[2313,["You’ll be amazed how your attention will rise"]],[2320,["and you’ll see all these nonsensical things"]],[2324,["which used to frighten you or to elate you,"]],[2327,["will drop out, and you will just smile at it."]],[2332,["And then only you are going to enjoy yourself fully"]],[2337,["because your attention"]],[2339,["will be completely drenched into the bliss of Self."]],[2347,["I am saying you will, I say you are"]],[2353,["already drenched into that bliss."]],[2359,["Keep it up."]],[2361,["Now, how to do it?"]],[2367,["Actually, in every day-to-day life, how to kill the memory of the past?"]],[2377,["To kill the memory of the past is to have new memories."]],[2384,["You must remember when you got your first Realisation"]],[2391,["– always think of it."]],[2392,["Whenever any such memory comes to you,"]],[2396,["you [should] try to think how you got your Realisation."]],[2401,["Any memory that is troublesome or even so-called elating,"]],[2407,["you just try to remember how Realisation has come to you."]],[2417,["When you feel aggressive about something or angry [about] something,"]],[2422,["just try to remember how you felt the joy of surrendering."]],[2430,["Just think of that joy of surrendering, of dissolving yourself."]],[2437,["So the new memories must be built up."]],[2441,["If you start building up new memories,"]],[2445,["then you will start collecting moments"]],[2448,["to establish other moments which have such memories."]],[2459,["Like a memory when you tried to help somebody,"]],[2463,["you raised the Kundalini of someone."]],[2468,["Now the problem would be when you will be raising the Kundalini of others,"]],[2471,["you will be in thoughtless awareness – there won’t be any thought –"]],[2475,["and thought is the only thing which impresses."]],[2478,["But [at] that time you can record the joy of raising the Kundalini."]],[2486,["If you could record the joy of raising the Kundalini of others,"]],[2496,["you will feel [that] a new wealth"]],[2502,["of these beautiful moments will be accumulated."]],[2507,["And all those moments which were giving you confusion"]],[2514,["or fear or so-called unhappiness and happiness will drop out"]],[2520,["and pure joy will remain."]],[2523,["Because now most of the experiences you have had are more of joy."]],[2530,["Joy has no thoughts."]],[2533,["It’s just an experience, a pratyaksha."]],[2541,["That’s why I said you keep your eyes open."]],[2547,["I hope you will understand what I mean by that."]],[2552,["May God bless you all."]],[2560,["I think let us meditate today."]],[2562,["Maybe this meditation will help us. Please close your eyes."]],[2567,["(break in recording)"]],[2576,["..all of you, these things, put it on the fire."]],[2578,["Douglas [Fry], take these two, these things, and take them on the fire."]],[2587,["(break in recording)"]],[2593,["…without paying attention here or there or without worrying."]],[2599,["Worry and all these things are vikshepas, are all confusions, comes from confusion."]],[2604,["You have known about me that I can sit for nine hours in one pose."]],[2610,["I mean I have done that but I can do even more."]],[2613,["So one has to develop a baithak, is a sitting posture, for some time."]],[2622,["You must settle down in some position. Alright?"]],[2625,["Should try to do that, and whatever is required for that is to be done"]],[2631,["because that’s the only way you can do it."]],[2634,["If you are walking, still your attention will be moving about."]],[2638,["Anyway, if there’s a movement then the time, space comes into play."]],[2643,["But if you can settle down, if you can have a place where you can sit down."]],[2649,["And that’s why the photograph helps."]],[2651,["If you can see the photograph continuously,"]],[2654,["with a relaxed eyes, not all the time staring but relaxed eyes."]],[2658,["You can close your eyes with respect [then] again you can open your eyes."]],[2661,["This settling down of the position"]],[2664,["– you will be surprised how your attention will"]],[2667,["gradually rise, you will feel it."]],[2672,["Just now you are all in thoughtless awareness so go into meditation."]],[2675,["No, if you cannot sit you can take a seat, you see, down below."]],[2679,["But as I said it, clothes should be a little lighter."]],[2684,["Alright, put your hands towards me. You have to sit for about now, five minutes."]],[2688,["I will not make you [sit] much."]],[2690,["But I hope you will develop it next time your sitting."]],[2797,["Right hand on the heart I think will help. Right hand on the heart."]],[2800,["Now do it with your heart. Do – it – with – your – heart."]],[2806,["Right hand on the heart."]],[2823,["Think within that, “I am the Eternal Life, I am the Spirit”"]],[2838,["Hold your breath."]],[2847,["Leave it."]],[2860,["This time when you hold your breath you should know that I am the Mother of the Universe"]],[2866,["and the most powerful personality."]],[2873,["And I am your Mother and you are all protected."]],[2877,["Hold your breath."]],[2885,["Haa! Leave it."]],[2905,["Good."]],[2907,["You are still children I must say."]],[2910,["Don’t you know that I’m very powerful?"]],[2912,["Have I to tell you?"]],[2915,["Even the small children know that."]],[2929,["Alright?"]],[2941,["Relax."]],[2948,["Let’s have some music and something."]],[2949,["Now, any questions anywhere?"]],[2957,["Yogi: I have a question. Could you explain the difference between joy and happiness?"]],[2961,["Shri Mataji: Oh!"]],[2963,["Very simple you know."]],[2964,["Joy doesn’t have a double thing like happiness and unhappiness."]],[2970,["Joy is singular, absolute."]],[2972,["It’s absolute. It is thoughtless."]],[2975,["It’s fulfilment."]],[2977,["Happiness is always shadowed by unhappiness,"]],[2982,["is the double coined stuff, double faces of a coin."]],[2987,["Happiness will be followed by unhappiness, unhappiness by happiness."]],[2991,["It’s a relative terminology."]],[2994,["But joy is absolute, absolute."]],[2998,["It’s beyond thought. It’s bliss."]],[3001,["Yogi: It’s more like contentment."]],[3004,["Shri Mataji: Contentment can be relative still."]],[3008,["But it’s all that in one."]],[3012,["Joy is where you do not ask anything anymore, you’re just there."]],[3019,["It just emits then. Just emits."]],[3025,["You don’t want anything, it just goes overflowing."]],[3031,["It has nothing to do with your rationality,"]],[3033,["cannot be perceived through your rationality."]],[3036,["It’s beyond, you just feel it."]],[3038,["Hmm. Jeremy?"]],[3040,["Jeremy: Why do we dream?"]],[3042,["What makes us dream?"]],[3044,["Shri Mataji: Dreams? Now dreams are you see:"]],[3046,["there are three stages of our consciousness in the normal way – not the fourth one"]],[3051,["that, now, you are in the fourth one – but normally there are three stages."]],[3058,["And the third stage is called as shushupti,"]],[3061,["where you are in a stage where you are deep asleep."]],[3067,["That time you come in contact with the unconscious."]],[3071,["Unconscious actually enters your attention,"]],[3074,["and you start getting the information from that."]],[3078,["But a person who is not yet realised"]],[3084,["is not yet quite awake in that state, in the sense that,"]],[3087,["whatever he records gets again clouded"]],[3089,["when he is coming back through those stages of…"]],[3092,["he comes through subconscious areas, lots of areas we can say,"]],[3098,["that he comes out of all the subconscious areas"]],[3101,["that he has got within him, and the supraconscious areas within him,"]],[3105,["and then he comes to conscious mind."]],[3107,["So lots of things cloud it, like covered it,"]],[3110,["so the interpretation or even the memory of"]],[3113,["the dream could be quite confused."]],[3115,["But after Realisation you touch even deeper because you enter into unconscious."]],[3120,["Not that The unconscious has to do anything,"]],[3123,["but you enter into the unconscious."]],[3125,["Your attention goes into the attention and it records what it sees."]],[3130,["The more you become Realised, the dream state will go away."]],[3135,["For example I never dream. I mean actually I am in dream."]],[3140,["I never dream in the sense that when I am so-called dreaming,"]],[3143,["I am actually there working it out."]],[3145,["And I can verify it with others that I was that time with you."]],[3149,["He says, “Yes, this happened.”"]],[3150,["So, you see, it’s a different state of mine."]],[3153,["But actually this happens, you never have a dream, you are always in reality."]],[3157,["But that’s a different thing. But at least"]],[3160,["whatever you record in that from the unconscious,"]],[3163,["at least should be your own."]],[3165,["But mostly the dreams of the people are clouded,"]],[3169,["so the dream doesn’t have much meaning."]],[3172,["But with Sahaja Yoga you are enlightened so much that,"]],[3177,["in your dreams also, you see what unconscious has to say actually."]],[3183,["Which is not confused, which is not clouded,"]],[3186,["which is absolutely with that you are awakened."]],[3189,["I mean, for example, you might see me, many a times, in dreams."]],[3193,["And suggestions you will get from me."]],[3196,["I mean, I work through dreams only, through the unconscious."]],[3199,["But some people always will say, “Oh, I have seen you somewhere."]],[3202,["I have seen you many a times. I don’t know where I have seen."]],[3205,["Were you in New York?” I said, “No.”"]],[3207,["“Then where did I see you?” They saw me in their sleep, you see."]],[3212,["But they cannot connect that it was in the sleep [that] they had seen me."]],[3217,["They are not Realised people but they have seen me."]],[3226,["Yogini: Can you give people Realisation in their sleep?"]],[3228,["Shri Mataji: No. No. I cannot."]],[3232,["I do not even want to give Realisation to people"]],[3234,["when they are not facing me, either my photograph or Sahaja Yogis."]],[3239,["That should not be. Because recognition is the only point in Sahaja Yoga."]],[3244,["Modern Sahaja Yoga is only going to work out if you recognise me!"]],[3250,["If you do not recognise me, it’s not going to work out."]],[3254,["This is the only way."]],[3256,["This is the only key?"]],[3259,["Because so far you have never recognised."]],[3261,["Only on recognition all your past things will be forgiven, everything will be done."]],[3265,["But if you refuse to recognise me or you go slow with it, your progress will be slow."]],[3269,["Which I have told you frankly."]],[3271,["Though it’s rather embarrassing job, but I have to tell you. This is a fact."]],[3277,["So in dream you cannot give Realisation."]],[3279,["But in dream you might see the situation in which will be giving,"]],[3283,["how you should give. Your solutions will be suggested to you,"]],[3286,["how to approach a particular person."]],[3290,["But you cannot give Realisation to anyone."]],[3293,["They have to know that they have got Realisation through Mataji Nirmala Devi."]],[3299,["As it is, when you give them Realisation, they have no value [for it]."]],[3303,["If they don’t know me, they will have no value."]],[3315,["But I would still suggest that one should not go on analysing the dreams too much."]],[3320,["Again the same problem will start."]],[3321,["Because I know Jung and all these people did that."]],[3324,["But that was alright at that stage because they were not Realised people,"]],[3328,["or they were Realised of a very confused manner,"]],[3332,["in the sense that they were not sure of themselves."]],[3334,["But you people do not go on bothering about dreams so much."]],[3337,["The dreams are coming to you to give you a solution of a problem."]],[3345,["The unconscious is helping you in dreams."]],[3347,["For example, when I go to India most of them dream that Mother is coming."]],[3354,["I mean it acts like television!"]],[3365,["Sahaja Yogi: I dreamt of you after the first time I came here."]],[3371,["Shri Mataji: After you came here? Not before?"]],[3374,["But there are people who have come to me because they dreamt about me also."]],[3378,["Now that’s a good thing. To dream about me means you’ve gone very deep."]],[3383,["The verification comes in."]],[3385,["Sahaja Yogi: When I was here, you put your hand over this eye, when I dreamt about it"]],[3393,["it was as though something was pulled out of it, like a crystal."]],[3398,["And it fell on the floor and it sort of grew legs and ran away."]],[3403,["(laughter)."]],[3411,["I used to suffer from headaches and since that time I haven’t."]],[3416,["Shri Mataji: You see! That’s true. That’s true."]],[3421,["I mean, actually it is done like that."]],[3424,["I’ll tell you an example, a very concrete example of this."]],[3427,["One man who used to come to Sahaja Yoga and was very deep into it."]],[3432,["You see some of the Rajneesh’s disciples wanted to sort of harm him."]],[3439,["So they called him and they said, “We’ll offer you a paan (leaf)”"]],[3443,["– you see, that we eat and all that."]],[3445,["And they really mesmerised him and gave him a paan."]],[3448,["He ate the paan and all that."]],[3450,["That was after the programme, about 10.30 he ate the paan,"]],[3454,["and he went into his subconscious areas."]],[3456,["But he was coming to consciousness little bit,"]],[3459,["and then they took him in the taxi and beat him."]],[3462,["But they could not beat!"]],[3464,["He could see that they used to come and beat him and their hands were held by somebody."]],[3468,["Could not feel the beating on him at all."]],[3471,["And he used to come to consciousness, again unconscious,"]],[3474,["and then he became absolutely conscious."]],[3476,["He saw them beating him and they were getting the pain"]],[3479,["as if beaten but he was never beaten up."]],[3482,["And then they left him in one place"]],[3486,["and then they took out his gold chain, and he had one ring"]],[3491,["of a real ruby on his fingers, they took out all that,"]],[3493,["and they left him in one place somewhere."]],[3496,["And he walked all the way from there to his house."]],[3501,["So, I saw all this happening to him"]],[3504,["and that I was trying to slap, bang these people and all that."]],[3508,["I saw all that, I was doing it."]],[3510,["So, early in the morning I got up, about six o’clock and I telephoned to his house and"]],[3514,["I said that how is he now? His wife said, “He came very late."]],[3517,["I mean he came really in the morning time about five o’clock."]],[3520,["And now he’s sleeping.” I said, “Let him sleep."]],[3523,["He has had a very bad time last night"]],[3525,["and he suffered a lot and these Rajneesh people"]],[3527,["have troubled him a lot,” I told her."]],[3529,["She was quite surprised, she didn’t know all these things!"]],[3532,["When he got up she asked, “Where did you go?” And he told all the story about it."]],[3536,["Then he telephoned to me and he said, “Mother, you were there to save me!”"]],[3539,["I said, “Alright.” I told him, but normally I don’t tell you."]],[3542,["But that day I just wanted to find out."]],[3544,["Then he said that, “I’ve lost my ring that was given to me by my father"]],[3550,["and I really feel sad about it.”"]],[3554,["So I said, “Alright you will find it."]],[3557,["Both the things you are going to get it.”"]],[3559,["And when he was getting down from the staircase"]],[3565,["he found a red kind of a bundle lying there."]],[3569,["And his wife said, “What is this red bundle lying here for?”"]],[3572,["So he picked it up. Inside was the ring and inside was his chain."]],[3577,["Then he immediately telephoned to me,"]],[3579,["“Mother I have found both the things, how did you manage?”"]],[3582,["You see it can be done."]],[3583,["So all that was done for them because you see one can work it out."]],[3587,["It can happen like that. But,"]],[3592,["you must know that everything is done through the power of Brahma,"]],[3596,["that’s the glow of Adi Shakti."]],[3599,["It’s all done through that. The rest is all myth."]],[3605,["If you are not frightened of the myth, and if you do not recognise the myth,"]],[3609,["you are above it! But you still recognise it."]],[3613,["This is the problem."]],[3619,["Sahaja Yogi: If you are a scientist say,"]],[3622,["are you saying that you shouldn’t continue scientific work?"]],[3626,["Shri Mataji: No, no, no. If you are a scientist"]],[3629,["then, after Realisation, what you should do is to bring"]],[3632,["science and Realisation together."]],[3635,["You can explain science and Realisation together."]],[3638,["You have to explain Realisation through scientific method."]],[3641,["This should be your effort, a new direction, because you have found out that you are Realised,"]],[3645,["you have found out that there is All-pervading Power, now, if you can put it"]],[3648,["in the scientific language you can talk to them."]],[3651,["So that knowledge is not wasted."]],[3656,["Supposing you are a geologist, you can explain many things of geology"]],[3661,["which you have not explained so far, through Realisation."]],[3666,["So you give actually the science it’s fulfilment itself!"]],[3669,["There are so many questions they cannot answer."]],[3682,["Every thing, politics, everything – why it has failed, what has happened,"]],[3688,["what is the reason – everything can be explained through science of Sahaja Yoga."]],[3695,["Everything! why it works out, why it doesn’t work out,"]],[3698,["what’s the thing, what is the failure is"]],[3700,["– everything can be explained."]],[3703,["Human behaviour, everything."]],[3709,["So use your knowledge to enlighten the knowledge"]],[3715,["which is covered with ignorance."]],[3728,["For example, see now, you have developed films, cinemas, this, that."]],[3734,["Use it for Sahaja Yoga."]],[3737,["How can you use it for Sahaja Yoga you should try to find out ways and methods."]],[3747,["Supposing you are a dramatist: use that drama."]],[3750,["Make a drama on Sahaja Yoga."]],[3768,["Put your mind to that and you can do it."]],[3771,["For example, supposing somebody is doing a course in journalism,"]],[3775,["then he should use his journalism for to propagate Sahaja Yoga."]],[3784,["You should try to find out in geology also, or in any subject whatsoever:"]],[3791,["the light of Sahaja Yoga which is being missed so far by the scientists,"]],[3796,["by the geologists, by the psychologists, by everyone,"]],[3798,["because it’s all a science which is secluded, which is"]],[3802,["in darkness, which has no connection with the whole."]],[3813,["Now you see your fire is here alright?"]],[3816,["Now, when I put my hand there, what happens is this fire is enlightened."]],[3822,["This power sucks in from you, or any one of you who are Realised-souls,"]],[3829,["whatever is within you which can be burnt away by fire,"]],[3838,["and it burns it off."]],[3842,["This fire you have analysed in ignorance but now you are enlightened."]],[3850,["I gave realisation in India"]],[3852,["to some scientists who were working on the agriculture."]],[3855,["They started using vibrations for agriculture"]],[3862,["and they were surprised that they could produce ten times more yield."]],[3867,["I mean, you can see the difference between"]],[3870,["the types of things that are being produced"]],[3872,["and they are doing tremendous work on that."]],[3875,["They’ll be publishing papers and things and they are doing that."]],[3882,["You can see also how vibrations work on say a nucleus of an atom."]],[3892,["They will be acted through mesotrons"]],[3895,["If you see that, mesotrons will immediately react to it because"]],[3898,["they are arbitrary and you will be amazed you can handle them"]],[3901,["and manoeuvre them through your vibrations,"]],[3904,["if you see them under microscope."]],[3908,["If you want to go into it you can go into it,"]],[3910,["because first of all you have to convince these horrible people"]],[3913,["what else could be, and give up everything else"]],[3918,["and just accept it be within it."]],[3926,["We are curing people without any science with us."]],[3930,["We are curing mad people without any science."]],[3932,["After all, everything is for the betterment of human beings."]],[3935,["We are improving food problem."]],[3940,["We are improving even material problem,"]],[3943,["everybody has got betterment,"]],[3946,["I mean, Lakshmi tattwa is improved in them."]],[3950,["All these things can be done."]],[3955,["And scientists can show that science taken to extreme"]],[3958,["can take [us] to destruction, which is not related to the whole."]],[3964,["If you move in one direction, a linear movement,"]],[3968,["it just coils back and comes back to you."]],[3971,["But if you are related to the whole then you know how to balance it,"]],[3976,["otherwise the nose starts growing or the ears start [growing] – it’s malignant."]],[3979,["The growth of science, the modern science, is malignant."]],[3983,["Even on Earth, if part of Earth starts growing, for example, on one side,"]],[3989,["the whole balance and equilibrium will be gone of the Earth, isn’t it!"]],[3994,["I mean if you see The Nature in its real completeness"]],[4000,["then you will see there’s such a balance existing."]],[4004,["Science just moves like a blind horse in one direction."]],[4012,["What is the use? Then you go to atom and from atom"]],[4015,["you go to atomic energy and from there to the destruction part."]],[4020,["But if you had kept to the truth and to the complete,"]],[4024,["then you would not have gone that far."]],[4027,["Alright, it’s useful for us, use it."]],[4032,["Analysis destroys you, destroys all our character, everything."]],[4038,["If you start analysing you, yourself, you’ll be destroyed."]],[4044,["Take yourself as a whole."]],[4049,["There are people I have known who analyse me also."]],[4051,["Such silly fools I have seen."]],[4055,["Haa, there are."]],[4064,["It’s so fantastic, the way human beings go about"]],[4071,["with there small little brain!"]],[4078,["Anything they cannot explain in Sahaja Yoga."]],[4083,["When you have the higher science to discover, forget the lower sciences."]],[4089,["I mean, when you were a frog,"]],[4093,["you were only worried about the well where you lived but"]],[4095,["now today you are a human being, you are worried about other things."]],[4098,["Now, if you become a super-human being, you should be worried about higher sciences."]],[4104,["Now what have you achieved through science we can achieve in a second through Sahaja Yoga."]],[4119,["Your material welfare can be, in a second we can improve it."]],[4123,["If you get your Realisation, materially you will be better off."]],[4133,["Most of the people they declare as coma and dead"]],[4136,["or lunatic and gone cases…"]],[4138,["they have not been able to cure any lunatic whatsoever."]],[4141,["Once he goes to the lunatic asylum he just comes [out] as a corpse."]],[4145,["He never comes back as a sane person."]],[4149,["What your science has achieved so far?"]],[4151,["And in which way?"]],[4153,["Take to anything: political problems, anything."]],[4157,["You try to have political, say democracy – you have created demonocracy."]],[4164,["You wanted to have communism – it is nothing but killing everyone."]],[4170,["Everything is a topsy turvy."]],[4172,["Hello! How are you?"]],[4177,["Come here you come here!"]],[4179,["You’re daddy has come?"]],[4183,["Child: Yes."]],[4184,["Shri Mataji: Where is he?"]],[4185,["Child: In there."]],[4186,["Shri Mataji: Oh, I see, I see. Sit down, sit down, sit down. Good!"]],[4192,["Now any other question?"]],[4194,["Should we have some music?"]],[4202,["Yogi: Mother, what is the true meaning of your name ‘Shri Bhagawati’?"]],[4205,["I have seen several different translations of the name"]],[4208,["Shri Mataji: You see,"]],[4209,["entirely different to each other."]],[4214,["‘Bh’ ‘ga’: “Bhaga” means six things all together."]],[4221,["They are the six attributes of God"]],[4225,["and Bhagawati is the power of God, that’s why She’s called that."]],[4230,["Six basic attributes of God."]],[4238,["First is innocence, second is creativity, third is…"]],[4278,["fatherliness, you can say, but"]],[4281,["is the one which nourishes."]],[4292,["You see if you put the gardener and the Mother Earth together"]],[4301,["then what is the quality of them, is nourishment to grow,"]],[4306,["looking after, called as ‘palanhaar’."]],[4310,["In English must be a word somewhere."]],[4313,["The ‘Patron’?"]],[4317,["But ‘patron’ doesn’t mean all that, isn’t it."]],[4321,["Yogi: Husbandry?"]],[4323,["Shri Mataji: Husbandry?"]],[4324,["‘Husbandry’ is a funny word! (laughter)"]],[4332,["Something like that."]],[4336,["‘Paternal’"]],[4338,["Shri Mataji: But it is also maternal, you see."]],[4342,["Yogini: Guardian?"]],[4343,["Shri Mataji: Guardian is only in control."]],[4345,["You see all these things put together is ‘palanhaar’."]],[4350,["Yogi: Sustainer."]],[4354,["Shri Mataji: Sustenance is also there."]],[4356,["But the kindness, the control, the looking after, the weeding out."]],[4361,["All the beauties of that and the enjoyment of seeing your creation."]],[4371,["The growth."]],[4372,["The One who makes our growth possible."]],[4385,["Then He is Almighty."]],[4389,["Almighty."]],[4391,["Nobody is more powerful than Him. He’s the most powerful."]],[4404,["And He encompasses everything."]],[4413,["He’s All-pervading and He knows everything – Sarvarupa."]],[4418,["He knows everything, omniscient."]],[4431,["This is ‘Bhaga’."]],[4432,["And Bhagawati is the power of God."]],[4440,["Without Bhagawati, God has no meaning."]],[4444,["It’s like moon and moonlight, it’s like sun and sunlight."]],[4450,["You cannot differentiate. They are just one and the same."]],[4455,["Yogi: Is Bhagawati Adi Shakti then?"]],[4459,["Shri Mataji: Adi Shakti is the same as Bhagawati."]],[4462,["She’s called by many names."]],[4465,["One of them is Nirmala also."]]]);
